      "claim": "The scam uses your name and phone number, which can be harvested from data breaches or public sources, and the information can be combined with other data for future attacks.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Your name and phone number may already appear on people-search sites or in data-broker databases. Removing that information won't erase data already exposed in a breach, but it can reduce what scammers can easily find and use to personalize future attacks."
